9
00:00:52.792 --> 00:01:01.165
(narrator) A green-phosphor terminal shows the computer reading 19 plus 00 as 1900, and a desk calendar tears from December 31, 1999 to January 1, 1900.

10
00:01:01.165 --> 00:01:14.110
(narrator) Another terminal file computes an age as 00 minus 85, which is minus 85 years old, while a young man born in 85 rewinds into a teen, a kid, a baby, a newborn, an egg cell, and then a puff of smoke with a question mark.

11
00:01:14.110 --> 00:01:23.789
(narrator) Twelve case files, from payroll to grades, all carry the same red YY secret tag and turn red; an intercept console searches for YY and finds it in file after file.

12
00:01:23.789 --> 00:01:37.090
(narrator) A mission clock turns over to January 1, 2000, celebratory fireworks bloom around it, almost nothing breaks, and red dollar bills fly away from behind a classified expense sheet that totals billions of dollars, stamped paid.

13
00:01:37.090 --> 00:01:46.116
(narrator) A case file gives the title, Every module should keep a secret, stamped top secret, and Agent 00 leans in with a finger across the lips, shh, and winks.

14
00:01:46.116 --> 00:01:57.754
(narrator) Then the agent slips away, the title shrinks into a corner, and a spy caper plays: two module agents, case files in fedoras and sunglasses, tiptoe in and hide behind newspapers from a searchlight.

15
00:01:57.754 --> 00:02:08.146
(narrator) Agent 00, the Payment Gateway, drops in upside down on a rope, backflips down, and builds a laser barrier between them and the rest of the system, then stands guard beside it.

16
00:02:08.146 --> 00:02:13.015
(narrator) A nosy third agent tries to peek, gets zapped, and asks the gateway agent instead.

17
00:02:13.015 --> 00:02:18.003
(narrator) Everyone says shh, Agent 00 raises the martini, and the scene is stamped classified.

18
00:02:18.003 --> 00:02:22.933
